{"title":"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0ebc92c0db065458bb1a37bfbdb89bb79a5bda33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{13}+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, the remainder is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/c/f2c96f39fa5865e85515c670d44147ad831415df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -1\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{None of these answers}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"522\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Using synthetic division, we get that the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/6/0767eab43354a52b47e69e32e893cbfe28f817dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>By the remainder theorem, the remainder is equal to the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0ebc92c0db065458bb1a37bfbdb89bb79a5bda33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{13}+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/b/d1b8493910324e61f0c60dd27c51570822377c0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> This gives the answer of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d843024b76384fb179919b8f451d4e7c689c3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\mathrm{D})\\ 2.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"59\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b770f9352670b9ebb0bd96152097322aeb23e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{13} - 1 = (x - 1)(x^{12} + x^{11} \\cdots + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"275\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65fc6ba6d95b078241d8db79f0950d5f5b4ab7a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{13} - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"54\" height=\"15\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6a82dff76c02c7fc53d045b6e407ba99c867ecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^{13} - 1) + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"19\" /> leaves a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/c/d5cb50982fd16d284fc74abfa8aa52d1e57b8a33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 2.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"59\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Say the quotient of the polynomial is \\( q \\) and the remainder is \\( r \\). Then we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/a/3fa38e9833f6dde2e67d2734f6e4715e69324263.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^{13} + 1 = (x - 1)q + r\\]\" width=\"174\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>To eliminate \\( q \\), we put \\( x = 1 \\) in which we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/9/5d9e1f25b27c02fb643a8f754b3d608d12cf8e7e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1^{13} + 1 = r\\]\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/b/c5b2588214b119d3ceb464493df595014b15016e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 + 1 = r\\]\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/4/3048d3d71f1541cbdb5e4a5a45cdaaff0c592103.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 = r\\]\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1d843024b76384fb179919b8f451d4e7c689c3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\mathrm{D})\\ 2.}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"59\" height=\"29\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/z4-bFo2D3TU?list=PLZ6lgLajy7SZ4MsF6ytXTrVOheuGNnsqn&amp;t=2485\">https://youtu.be/z4-bFo2D3TU?list=PLZ6lgLajy7SZ4MsF6ytXTrVOheuGNnsqn&amp;t=2485</a> - AMBRIGGS\nIt's fake.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME\" title=\"1950 AHSME\">1950 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1950 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1950\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1950_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1950 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</